    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing capabilities and expertise, we can propose a comprehensive solution that meets the client's requirements while ensuring sovereignty of data, compliance with regulatory requirements, and minimizing environmental footprint. we typical approach involves a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services, which aligns with the project deployment constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information and expects a solution contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution should rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability measures can we implement to reduce our environmental footprint, and what are the associated benefits?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We can implement several sustainability measures to reduce our environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we can utilize green hosting partners such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy. utilize will significantly reduce the carbon emissions associated with we data centers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we practice digital sobriety through various means like INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, and auto-scaling to zero outside business hours. we also employ query result caching, which is estimated to reduce recomputes by around 20%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we green IT hardware procurement policy ensures a minimum 5-year lifecycle for we equipment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures, we can achieve an average energy reduction of 35% compared to we baseline. achieve not only reduces our environmental footprint but also contributes to the client's goal of limiting the environmental footprint of the client's systems of information and reducing energetic consumption.  we e-waste management partner, Ecologic, is certified for WEEE recycling, ensuring responsible disposal of electronic waste. we also have the capability for carbon reporting, following the GRI Standards, which enables we to track and disclose we carbon emissions effectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact and implementing these sustainability measures, we can provide a solution that aligns with the client's expectations while minimizing our environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a duration of 4 years, with a pilot phase on a limited scope followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an accompaniment to change and training for the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What project management strategy can we propose to ensure successful deployment, and what are the key milestones and risks associated with The project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we company context, we can propose a project management strategy that leverages we experience in managing large-scale public sector IT projects. we approach will be based on the PRINCE2 methodology, which is one of the methodologies we are certified in." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful deployment, we suggest dividing The project into four phases: Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the Inception & Design phase, we will work closely with the client to define the project scope, identify key stakeholders, and develop a detailed project plan. the Inception & Design phase will also include the design of the intelligent assistance tool and the development of a change management strategy. a pilot phase on a limited scope will involve deploying the solution on a limited scope to test the solution functionality and gather feedback from the agents. a pilot phase on a limited scope is crucial in identifying and addressing any technical or operational issues before proceeding with the full rollout." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Full Rollout will involve deploying the solution to the entirety of the services, providing accompaniment to change and training for the agents. we dedicated change manager will work closely with the client to ensure a smooth transition and minimize disruption to the client operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, Operations & Support will focus on ensuring the long-term sustainability of the solution, providing ongoing maintenance and support, and monitoring the solution performance to identify areas for improvement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of key milestones, we can expect the following: completion of a pilot phase on a limited scope, successful deployment of the full rollout, achievement of the desired level of user adoption, and realization of the expected benefits." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for risks, we have identified several potential risks, including technical issues, resistance to change from the agents, and delays in the project timeline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate several potential risks, including technical issues, resistance to change from the agents, and delays in the project timeline, we will maintain a risk register, review a risk register bi-weekly, and develop contingency plans to address any potential issues that may arise. we team of certified project managers, including PMP and PRINCE2 Practitioner certified professionals, will work closely with the client to ensure that The project is delivered on time, within budget, and to the required quality standards. we are confident that we experience in managing large-scale public sector IT projects, combined with we expertise in AI solutions and change management, makes we well-suited to deliver The project successfully." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and expects a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should be designed as a tool of assistance, with no decision automated without explicit validation of an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR compliance, as indicated by the presence of a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2 and we standard legal basis being Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR. we also have support available for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the automation of decisions, we has a policy of no automated decision-making without human validation, which aligns with the requirement that no decision should be automated without explicit validation of an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag the potential legal risk of ensuring ongoing compliance with GDPR, particularly in relation to data processing and protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As we operate within the EU and have experience with intra-EU operations, we do not anticipate issues related to Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) or adequacy decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another potential risk could be related to the integration of The solution with existing systems of information, as well as business software, civil status, town planning, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories. we should ensure that such integrations do not introduce any GDPR compliance risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, given we standard intellectual property model is based on a work-for-hire basis, where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment, we should verify that a work-for-hire basis, where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment complies with the regulatory requirements and does not pose any risks related to data ownership or sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of compliance, based on the information provided in we company context, it appears that we have measures in place to address the regulatory requirements mentioned, including GDPR compliance and the avoidance of automated decision-making without human validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, a detailed review of the specific tender requirements and we policies and procedures would be necessary to confirm full compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. specialized agents, is pleased to submit a tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions for the City of Belval. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions for the City of Belval leverages Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. commitment to sovereignty, security, and sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
