    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Understanding of Requirements Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have carefully reviewed the call for tenders issued by the City of Belval and understand the need for an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment must facilitate information search, provide drafting help, assist in file instruction, suggest actions or steps within administrative processes, and ensure seamless integration with existing practices and systems without disrupting current workflows. # 3." ;
