        ex:hasText "For API integration with civil-status software, town-planning systems, EDM, and user directories, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will use API standards like REST and GraphQL, along with Kong as the API gateway. **Security and Compliance**: To ensure GDPR compliance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will guarantee EU-only hosting, prevent data transfers outside EU, protect sensitive data through encryption (utilizing tools such as Microsoft Presidio for anonymization), and implement a human oversight mechanism to validate automated decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

