    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose? our technical expertise includes cloud architecture, API integration, and cybersecurity, which are relevant to meeting The client requirements. our have experience with cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), all of which are the EU-based and can meet the hosting requirements." ;
