    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve a response time of less than 2 seconds and 99.9% availability, our can leverage our expertise in containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure efficient deployment and scaling of The solution. our also have experience with monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana, which can help our meet the availability requirement." ;
