    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For API integration, our can utilize our knowledge of API standards like REST and GraphQL, as well as API gateways like Kong, to integrate with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories. our experience with identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP and Keycloak will also be beneficial for integrating with user directories." ;
