        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we context, we maximum contract value eligibility is 3,000,000 EUR, which matches The total contract value. we also meet the minimum turnover threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine the projected margin, let's consider the contract value over 4 years, which is 3,000,000 EUR. we target gross margin percentage is 28%, but we need to ensure that we pricing model allows we to achieve 28% while optimizing costs for The client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we standard daily rates and infrastructure margin percentage of 12%, we can aim to allocate resources efficiently to meet The client expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without specific details on the project's requirements and resource allocation, it's challenging to provide an exact projected margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding cost-optimization strategies, we can propose absorbing potential budget reductions via rate renegotiation with subcontractors, as indicated in we cost sensitivity analysis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For more significant budget reductions, we could suggest scope reduction by removing optional modules or reducing training days." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can optimize costs by ensuring efficient allocation of resources, streamlining processes, and leveraging we expertise to deliver high-quality services while minimizing expenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's essential to note that we minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18%, which will guide we pricing strategy to ensure we can deliver quality services while maintaining a viable business model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should provide intelligent assistance to agents, facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The AI system should be able to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation, provide help with drafting administrative contents, and suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, we can propose a solution that leverages we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to provide high-quality answers and suggestions for administrative tasks. we can utilize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities to enable The AI system to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation, and provide help with drafting administrative contents. we chunking strategies and vector stores experience can facilitate efficient retrieval of relevant information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve answer quality and reduce processing times, we can employ we fine-tuning methods, such as LoRA or QLoRA, to adapt the model to the specific tone and format required for administrative tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can use quantization methods like INT8 to optimize the model performance while minimizing energy consumption. we innovation strategy involves continuous research and development in AI, with a focus on knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks. we can also explore proactive regulatory change alerting to ensure the solution remains up-to-date with changing regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

